2444 {\cf20 //     u# register (D3D11_SB_OPERAND_TYPE_UNORDERED_ACCESS_VIEW) is being declared.}\par
2445 {\cf20 //     The indexing dimension for the register must be D3D10_SB_OPERAND_INDEX_DIMENSION_3D, }\par
2446 {\cf20 //     and the meaning of the index dimensions are as follows: (u<id>[<lbound>:<ubound>])}\par
2447 {\cf20 //       1 <id>:     variable ID being declared}\par
2448 {\cf20 //       2 <lbound>: the lower bound of the range of UAV's in the space}\par
2449 {\cf20 //       3 <ubound>: the upper bound (inclusive) of this range}\par
2450 {\cf20 //     As opposed to when the u# is used in shader instructions, where the register}\par
2451 {\cf20 //     must be D3D10_SB_OPERAND_INDEX_DIMENSION_2D, and the meaning of the index }\par
